{"unit_id":"tag:03X7:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在大（big）或小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）上、对于 <MATH_0001> 的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category），只依赖于 <MATH_0002> 或 <MATH_0003> 中由仿射概形（affines）组成的满子范畴（full subcategory）；而且只需考虑它们之间的标准（standard）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（coverings）（定义见下文）。这给出景（sites）<MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005>，参见《拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001>。比较结果已在《拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003> 中证明。下面给出标准（standard）覆盖（coverings）的定义，适用于本章将考虑的若干拓扑（topologies）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"大小限定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"大小限定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"景的类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准","context":"覆盖类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"景论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term"