{"unit_id":"tag:03X9:statement","translation":"（参见《拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004> 和 <REF_0005>。）设 <MATH_0001>。设 <MATH_0002> 为仿射概形（affine scheme）。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准（standard）<MATH_0003>-覆盖（covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对于 <MATH_0004>，是一个族（family）<MATH_0005>，其中每个 <MATH_0006> 都是仿射的（affine），每个 <MATH_0007> 分别是平坦的（flat）且有限表示的（finite presentation）、标准（standard）综合的（syntomic）、标准（standard）光滑的（smooth）、平展的（<ACCENT_0001>tale），或<SPACE_0001>是 <MATH_0008> 中一个标准（standard）主开集（principal open）的浸入（immersion），并且 <MATH_0009>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示的"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综合的"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展的"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准"},{"source_term":"principal open","target_term":"主开集"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"来源章名，待决定。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"standard","target_term":"标准","context":"定义限定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"景论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"数学用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"概形性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"态射性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示的","context":"态射性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"综合的","context":"无批准译名，明确暂译并待决定。"},{"sou