{"unit_id":"tag:03X7:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n为完整起见，我们陈述并证明所考虑的上同调群（cohomology groups）对于部分宇宙（partial universe）选择的不变性（invariance）。我们将在下面证明小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos）的不变性（invariance），见引理 <REF_0001>。本引理中使用的记号和术语参见《拓扑（Topologies）》第 <REF_0002> 节。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"partial universe","target_term":"部分宇宙"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"上同调用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"partial universe","target_term":"部分宇宙","context":"大小约定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"invariance","target_term":"不变性","context":"比较性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"大小限定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"景的类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"拓扑斯用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"来源章名，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YY:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>。设 <MATH_0002> 为概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 为两个大（big）<MATH_0005>-景（sites），属于 <MATH_0006>，并假设前者包含于后者。此时 <STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>对于任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0007>，定义在 <MATH_0008> 上，以及任意对象（object）<MATH_0009>，属于 <MATH_0010>，有 <MATH_0011>。用文字表述：上同调（cohomology），对于 <MATH_0012>，在 <MATH_0013> 上、在较大的景（site）中计算，与上同调（cohomology）相同，后者对于 <MATH_0014>，限制到较小的景（site）后，在 <MATH_0015> 上计算。<STRUCT_0003>对于任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0016>，在 <MATH_0017> 上，存在阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0018>，在 <MATH_0019> 上，其到 <MATH_0020> 的限制（restriction）与 <MATH_0021> 同构（isomorphic）。<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"景的大小，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"上同调用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"层的限制，待决定。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"层的同构，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04HQ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为概形（scheme）。<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展拓扑斯（<ACCENT_0001>tale topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0002>小平展拓扑斯（small <ACCENT_0002>tale topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，对于 <MATH_0002>，是范畴（category）<MATH_0003>，由取值于集合（sets）的层（sheaves）组成，定义在小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）景（site）上，属于 <MATH_0004>。<STRUCT_0003><TEXTITOPEN_0003>Zariski 拓扑斯（Zariski topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，或<TEXTITOPEN_0004>小 Zariski 拓扑斯（small Zariski topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>，对于 <MATH_0005>，是范畴（category）<MATH_0006>，由取值于集合（sets）的层（sheaves）组成，定义在 <MATH_0007> 的小 Zariski 景（small Zariski site）上。<STRUCT_0004>对于 <MATH_0008>，一个<TEXTITOPEN_0005>大（big）<MATH_0009>-拓扑斯（topos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0005>是由取值于集合（set）的层（sheaves）组成的范畴（category），定义在大（big）<MATH_0010>-拓扑斯（topos）上，属于 <MATH_0011>。<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale topos","target_term":"平展拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"small étale topos","target_term":"小平展拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Zariski topos","target_term":"Zariski 拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"small Zariski topos","target_term":"小 Zariski 拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小 Zariski 景"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_