{"unit_id":"tag:04HP:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，<MATH_0001> 的小（small）Zariski 拓扑斯（topos）就是 <MATH_0002> 的底层拓扑空间（topological space）上集合（sets）的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category），参见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0001>。虽然小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos）不依赖于构造小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）时所作的选择，但大（big）拓扑斯（topoi）一般确实依赖于这些选择。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n大（big）或小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）拓扑斯（topos）实际上只依赖于 <MATH_0003> 或 <MATH_0004> 中由仿射概形（affines）组成的满子范畴（full subcategory），参见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>。例如，我们将在下面引理的证明中使用这一点。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"大小限定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"拓扑斯用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"概形的底层空间，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"层论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴",