{"unit_id":"tag:0958:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为概形（scheme）。平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topos），对于 <MATH_0002>，在相差典范（canonical）等价（equivalence）的意义下，不依赖于小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）的构造（定义 <REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"景的类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"拓扑斯用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"等价性质，待决定。"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"范畴论用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"大小限定，待决定。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"景论用语，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
